                                     &lt;/li&gt;=0A                              =
                                  &lt;li&gt;=0A                                  =
                                  &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key +=
 R.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;=
/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=
=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;N=
ext, the Run dialogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                =
                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                   =
                             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                       =
                             &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.=
DevicesAndPrinters.=E2=80=9D=0A                                            =
                        &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                            =
                    &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                               =
                 &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                   =
                 &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                =
                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                   =
                                             &lt;li&gt;=0A                       =
                                             &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Print=
ers folder will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                               =
                 &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                      =
              &lt;p&gt;Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A =
                                                                   &lt;/p&gt;=0A =
