                     &lt;/div&gt;=0A=0A                                          =
              &lt;div class=3D&quot;shadow cardbackgroundcolor p-3 my-3 setformac&quot;&gt;=
=0A                                                            &lt;h3 class=3D=
&quot;mt-2 my-3 text-primary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A              =
                                              &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelist=
ing p-0&quot;&gt;=0A                                                               =
 &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                   =
 &lt;p&gt;Firstly, you will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                =
                                                        printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A    =
                                                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A       =
                                                         &lt;li&gt;=0A           =
                                                         &lt;p&gt;Next, connect t=
he printer to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                 =
                               &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                    =
                            &lt;li&gt;=0A                                        =
                            &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download th=
e printer=0A                                                               =
         driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                    =
            &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                       =
         &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                           =
         &lt;p&gt;Then, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A         =
